#: prefdlg.cpp:844
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Email client:"
msgstr "Nettpostprogramm:"

#: prefdlg.cpp:846
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "KMail"
msgstr "KMail"

#: prefdlg.cpp:847
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Sendmail"
msgstr "Sendmail"

#: prefdlg.cpp:857
#, qt-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>Choose how to send email when an email alarm is triggered."
"<list><item><interface>%1</interface>: The email is sent automatically via "
"<application>KMail</application>. <application>KMail</application> is "
"started first if necessary.</item><item><interface>%2</interface>: The email "
"is sent automatically. This option will only work if your system is "
"configured to use <application>sendmail</application> or a sendmail "
"compatible mail transport agent.</item></list></para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wodennig Nettbreven loosstüert warrt, wenn "
"en Nettpostalarm utlööst warrt.<list><item><interface>%1</interface>: De "
"Nettbreef warrt automaatsch mit <application>KMail</application> loosstüert. "
"<application>KMail</application> warrt toeerst opropen, wenn't noot deit.</"
"item><item><interface>%2</interface>: De Nettbreef warrt automaatsch "
"loosstüert. Disse Optschoon funkscheneert bloots, wenn op Dien Systeem "
"<application>sendmail</application> oder en kompatibel Programm inricht is.</"
"item></list></para>"

#: prefdlg.cpp:865
#, qt-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid ""
"Copy sent emails into <application>KMail</application>'s <resource>%1</"
"resource> folder"
msgstr ""
"Loosstüert Nettbreven na den Orner <resource>%1</resource> vun "
"<application>KMail</application> koperen"

#: prefdlg.cpp:867
#, qt-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"After sending an email, store a copy in <application>KMail</application>'s "
"<resource>%1</resource> folder"
msgstr ""
"Wohrt na't Loosstüern vun en Nettbreef en Kopie binnen <application>KMail</"
"application> sien <resource>%1</resource>-Orner."

#: prefdlg.cpp:872
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Your Email Address"
msgstr "Dien Nettpostadress"

#: prefdlg.cpp:879
msgctxt "@label 'From' email address"
msgid "From:"
msgstr "Vun:"

#: prefdlg.cpp:893
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Your email address, used to identify you as the sender when sending email "
"alarms."
msgstr ""
"Dien Nettpostadress. Se warrt in dat <interface>Vun</interface>-Feld "
"inföögt, wenn en Alarm en Nettbreef loosstüert."

#: prefdlg.cpp:900 prefdlg.cpp:940
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Use address from Control Center"
msgstr "Adress ut dat Kuntrullzentrum bruken"

#: prefdlg.cpp:904
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Check to use the email address set in the KDE Control Center, to identify "
"you as the sender when sending email alarms."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du de Nettpostadress ut dat KDE-Kuntrullzentrum för't "
"<interface>Vun</interface>-Feld bruken wullt, wenn en Alarm en Nettbreef "
"loosstüert."

#: prefdlg.cpp:908
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Use <application>KMail</application> identities"
msgstr "<application>KMail</application>-Identiteten bruken"

#: prefdlg.cpp:912
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Check to use <application>KMail</application>'s email identities to identify "
"you as the sender when sending email alarms. For existing email alarms, "
"<application>KMail</application>'s default identity will be used. For new "
"email alarms, you will be able to pick which of <application>KMail</"
"application>'s identities to use."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du de Nettpostidentiteten vun <application>KMail</"
"application> för dat <interface>Vun</interface>-Feld bruken wullt, wenn en "
"Alarm en Nettbreef loosstüert. För al vörhannen Alarms warrt de "
"Standardidentiteet bruukt, bi niege kannst Du de Identiteet utsöken."

#: prefdlg.cpp:919
msgctxt "@label 'Bcc' email address"
msgid "Bcc:"
msgstr "Blindkopie:"

#: prefdlg.cpp:932
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Your email address, used for blind copying email alarms to yourself. If you "
"want blind copies to be sent to your account on the computer which "
"<application>KAlarm</application> runs on, you can simply enter your user "
"login name."
msgstr ""
"De Nettpostadress, de en Blindkopie vun de Alarmnettbreven tostüert warrt. "
"Wenn Du Blindkopien Dien Konto op den Reekner tostüern wullt, op den ok "
"KAlarm löppt, kannst Du eenfach Dien Brukernaam ingeven."

#: prefdlg.cpp:944
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Check to use the email address set in the KDE Control Center, for blind "
"copying email alarms to yourself."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du Blindkopien vun de Alarmnettbreven Dien egen "
"Nettpostadress tostüern wullt, de in't Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt is."

#: prefdlg.cpp:951
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Notify when remote emails are queued"
msgstr "Bescheed geven, wenn Nettbreven na anner Lüüd inreegt warrt"

#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file kalarmconfig.kcfg line 385
#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file ./kalarmconfig.kcfg line 385
#: prefdlg.cpp:954 rc.cpp:488 rc.cpp:994
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Display a notification message whenever an email alarm has queued an email "
"for sending to a remote system. This could be useful if, for example, you "
"have a dial-up connection, so that you can then ensure that the email is "
"actually transmitted."
msgstr ""
"Gifft Bescheed, wenn en Nettpostalarm en Nettbreef en anner Reekner tostüern "
"schull un den Nettbreef de Töövreeg toföögt hett. Dat mag a.B. denn goot "
"wesen, wenn Du en Inwählverbinenn bruukst. Du kannst denn besekern, wat de "
"Nettbreef redig loosstüert warrt."

#: prefdlg.cpp:1038
