msgstr "Nafraagt Schriftoort"

#: calendarcompat.cpp:93
#, qt-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Resource <resource>%1</resource> is in an old format (<application>KAlarm</"
"application> version %2), and will be read-only unless you choose to update "
"it to the current format."
msgstr ""
"Ressource <resource>%1</resource> hett en ool Formaat (<application>KAlarm</"
"application> Verschoon %2). Se blifft so lang bloots leesbor, as Du ehr nich "
"op't aktuelle Formaat opfrischst."

#: calendarcompat.cpp:95
#, qt-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Some or all of the alarms in resource <resource>%1</resource> are in an old "
"<application>KAlarm</application> format, and will be read-only unless you "
"choose to update them to the current format."
msgstr ""
"En poor oder all Alarms binnen de Ressource <resource>%1</resource> hebbt en "
"ool <application> KAlarm</application>-Formaat. Se blievt so lang bloots "
"leesbor, as Du se nich op't aktuelle Formaat opfrischst."

#: calendarcompat.cpp:98
#, qt-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<para>%1</para><para><warning>Do not update the resource if it is shared "
"with other users who run an older version of <application>KAlarm</"
"application>. If you do so, they may be unable to use it any more.</"
"warning></para><para>Do you wish to update the resource?</para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>%1</para><para><warning>Du muttst de Ressource nich opfrischen, wenn "
"Du ehr mit anner Brukers deelst, de en öller Verschoon vun "
"<application>KAlarm</application> hebbt. Deist Du dat liekers, köönt se ehr "
"wull nich mehr bruken.</warning></para><para> Wullt Du de Ressource "
"opfrischen?</para>"

