#. i18n: tag whatsthis
#. i18n: file ./kalarmconfig.kcfg line 189
#: rc.cpp:200 rc.cpp:706
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Your email address, used to identify you as the sender when sending email "
"alarms. Enter \"@ControlCenter\" to use the email address set in the Control "
"Center, \"@KMail\" to allow choice of KMail identities, or enter the actual "
"email address otherwise."
msgstr ""
"De Nettpostadress, de vun Nettpostalarms na't \"Vun\"-Feld inföögt warrt. "
"Mit \"@ControlCenter\" warrt de Adress ut dat Kuntrullzentrum bruukt, bi "
"\"@KMail\" laat sik de KMail-Identiteten utsöken, oder sünst en propper "
"Nettpostadress."

#. i18n: tag label
#. i18n: file kalarmconfig.kcfg line 193
