#. i18n: file ./kalarmconfig.kcfg line 194
#: rc.cpp:208 rc.cpp:714
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Your email address, used for blind copying email alarms to yourself. If you "
"want blind copies to be sent to your account on the computer which KAlarm "
"runs on, you can simply enter your user login name. Enter \"@ControlCenter\" "
"to use the email address set in the Control Center, or enter the actual "
"email address otherwise."
msgstr ""
"De Nettpostadress, de en Blindkopie vun de Alarmnettbreven tostüert warrt. "
"Wenn Du Blindkopien Dien Konto op den Reekner tostüern wullt, op den ok "
"KAlarm löppt, kannst Du eenfach Dien Brukernaam ingeven. Giff "
"\"@ControlCenter\" in, wenn Du de Adress bruken wullt, de Du binnen dat "
"Kuntrullzentrum fastleggt hest, oder sünst en anner propper Nettpostadress."

